@page
@model PasswordModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "비밀번호 변경";
    ViewData["MainClass"] = "site-main-account-security";
}

<header class="ivory-page-heading">
    <div>
        <p class="ivory-heading-label">SECURITY</p>
        <h1>비밀번호 변경</h1>
        <p>현재 비밀번호를 확인한 뒤 계정에 사용할 새 비밀번호를 설정합니다.</p>
    </div>
</header>

<partial name="_AccountTools" />

<div class="ivory-security-layout">
    <section class="ivory-profile-information" aria-labelledby="password-form-heading">
        <div class="ivory-settings-heading">
            <p class="ivory-card-label">PASSWORD</p>
            <h2 id="password-form-heading">새 비밀번호 설정</h2>
            <p>세 입력을 모두 확인한 뒤 변경을 완료합니다.</p>
        </div>

        <form method="post" class="ivory-settings-form">
            <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" role="alert"></div>

            <div class="field-group">
                <label asp-for="CurrentPassword" class="field-label">현재 비밀번호</label>
                <input asp-for="CurrentPassword" class="field-input" autocomplete="current-password" />
                <span asp-validation-for="CurrentPassword" class="field-error"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="ivory-password-divider"><span>새 비밀번호</span></div>

            <div class="field-group">
                <label asp-for="NewPassword" class="field-label">새 비밀번호</label>
                <input asp-for="NewPassword" class="field-input" autocomplete="new-password" />
                <span asp-validation-for="NewPassword" class="field-error"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
                <label asp-for="ConfirmNewPassword" class="field-label">새 비밀번호 확인</label>
                <input asp-for="ConfirmNewPassword" class="field-input" autocomplete="new-password" />
                <span asp-validation-for="ConfirmNewPassword" class="field-error"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="ivory-settings-actions">
                <button type="submit" class="button-primary">비밀번호 변경</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </section>

    <aside class="ivory-side-card ivory-security-note">
        <div class="ivory-security-note-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
        <p class="ivory-card-label">SESSION RESET</p>
        <h2>모든 기기에서 로그아웃</h2>
        <p>비밀번호 변경이 완료되면 계정 보호를 위해 현재 기기를 포함한 모든 로그인 세션이 종료됩니다.</p>
    </aside>
</div>
